Third-Party Software Notices
============================

This project ships with, downloads, or calls the third-party work listed here.
Each entry gives the licence it is distributed under and where it comes from.
The Python section is generated (`make notices`); everything else is kept by
hand. The project itself is MIT (see LICENSE).


Models (downloaded by `immich-memories models fetch`, digest-pinned in code)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

DINOv2 small (facebook/dinov2-small)
  Role: the frozen picture encoder every editorial fact is computed from
  Artifact: dinov2-small-478164cd.onnx, an ONNX export of the checkpoint,
    served from this repository's `models-v1` release, 84 MB,
    sha256 478164cd290ee78e5ddb4fcc474136eec714b4b8253a3609cc7164b592e958af
  License: Apache-2.0
  Copyright: Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates
  URL: https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov2-small
  Paper: Oquab et al., "DINOv2: Learning Robust Visual Features without
    Supervision", 2023
  Note: the six linear heads that read its features are trained by this project
    and ship inside the Python package under the project licence.

Marqo NSFW image detector (Marqo/nsfw-image-detection-384)
  Role: the sensitive-content detector behind the family-viewing gate
  Artifact: nsfw-marqo-384-924658f1.onnx, an ONNX export of revision
    0c26ec22111b83f106d72a55f611ec35962bcb65 written by
    scripts/export_marqo_onnx.py, served from the `models-v1` release, 22 MB,
    sha256 924658f1ac638d96e9126ecb29de047dc8d31c9c9defcab77a26a5c96ed69e11
  License: Apache-2.0
  Copyright: Marqo
  URL: https://huggingface.co/Marqo/nsfw-image-detection-384

Docling document figure classifier (docling-project/DocumentFigureClassifier-v2.0)
  Role: tells a screenshot, a scan or a chart from a photograph
  Artifact: model.onnx at revision 2a12e02668b98ca40216eab41cdf19530577cba4,
    fetched from the Hugging Face Hub into the local cache on first use
  License: Apache-2.0
  Copyright: IBM Corporation (Docling project)
  URL: https://huggingface.co/docling-project/DocumentFigureClassifier-v2.0

Optional models the app can call but never bundles: a caption model and a text
reader served by the operator (any OpenAI-compatible endpoint), MusicGen
(Meta, CC-BY-NC-4.0 weights) and ACE-Step (Apache-2.0) for generated music,
Demucs (MIT, weights downloaded by the `demucs` package) for stem separation.
Their licences are the operator's to check for the models they choose.


Apache-2.0 notice
-----------------

The three models above are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Their ONNX exports are
derivative works of those checkpoints and carry the same licence; no NOTICE
file accompanies the upstream checkpoints.


Bundled music (packages/immich-memories-music)
----------------------------------------------

28 tracks generated locally with ACE-Step 1.5 (acestep-v15-xl-turbo). Nothing is
sampled from or trained on third-party recordings; the tracks are released under
the project's MIT licence. Model, settings, and per-track tempo, key and seed are
recorded in packages/immich-memories-music/LICENSE-MUSIC.

ACE-Step (the generator, not shipped)
  License: Apache-2.0
  URL: https://github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step


